and sharing your recordings.</li><li><strong>To authenticate you</strong>— managing your account and session via Supabase Auth.</li><li><strong>To process payments</strong>— handling "Support Me" contributions via our payment processor.</li><li><strong>To communicate with you</strong>— sending transactional emails (account confirmation, password reset, receipts). We do not send marketing emails without your explicit opt-in.</li><li><strong>To improve the product</strong>— analysing aggregated,
anonymised usage data to understand how features are used.</li><li><strong>To ensure security</strong>— detecting abuse,
fraud,
and violations of our Terms of Service.</li><li><strong>To comply with legal obligations</strong>— responding to lawful requests from authorities.</li></ul><h3>Legal basis for processing (GDPR)</h3><p>If you are in the European Economic Area,
our legal bases for processing are: <strong>contractual necessity</strong>(to deliver the Service you signed up for),
<strong>legitimate interests</strong>(security, fraud prevention, product improvement),
and <strong>consent</strong>(where you have actively opted in, e.g. marketing emails or enabling mic/camera capture).</p></div>< !-- 5 --><div class="section" id="s5"><div class="section-number">05</div><h2>Payments &amp;
"Support Me" Billing</h2><p>VibeCam offers an optional "Support Me" contribution feature. All payment processing is handled by a third-party payment processor (Stripe or a similar PCI-DSS compliant provider). <strong>We never see,
store,
or process your full card number,
CVV,
or sensitive payment credentials.</strong></p><h3>What we store</h3><ul><li>Transaction ID (from the payment processor)</li><li>Amount and currency</li><li>Billing email address</li><li>Country of the payment method (for tax purposes)</li><li>Date and status of the transaction</li></ul><h3>What the payment processor stores</h3><p>Our payment processor stores your full card details under their own privacy policy and PCI-DSS compliance obligations. Please review their privacy policy before making a payment. Links are provided at checkout.</p><h3>Refunds</h3><p>"Support Me" contributions are voluntary donations to support the development of VibeCam. As such,
they are generally non-refundable. If you believe a transaction was made in error,
contact us at the address in Section 12 within 14 days and we will review it.</p><h3>No subscription tracking without consent</h3><p>We do not link your payment history to your recording activity for profiling purposes. Payment records are held separately and used only for financial and legal compliance.</p></div>< !-- 6 --><div class="section" id="s6"><div class="section-number">06</div><h2>Data Storage &amp;
Retention</h2><h3>Where your data is stored</h3><p>VibeCam's infrastructure is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare</strong> (CDN, object storage, serverless functions) and <strong>Supabase</strong> (authentication and database). Both providers operate data centres in the US and EU. You can review their data processing agreements on their respective websites.</p>

