go to Settings → Account → Delete Account,
or contact us directly. We will action deletion requests within 30 days.</p></div>< !-- 7 --><div class="section" id="s7"><div class="section-number">07</div><h2>Sharing with Third Parties</h2><p>We do not sell your data. We share data only in these limited circumstances:</p><h3>Service providers (sub-processors)</h3><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Data shared</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Supabase</td><td>Authentication,
