Tracking</h2><p>VibeCam uses a minimal set of cookies and local storage entries:</p><ul><li><strong>Session cookie (Supabase):</strong>A secure,
HTTP-only cookie used to keep you logged in. Essential and cannot be disabled.</li><li><strong>Preference storage (localStorage):</strong>Saves your mic/camera toggle preferences between sessions. No personal data.</li><li><strong>Recording storage (IndexedDB):</strong>Stores your recordings locally when using the app in no-backend mode. Data never leaves your device.</li></ul><p>We do not use advertising cookies,
